# The deployable artifact and its sources must stay byte-stable across platforms.
# tools/build_contract.py --check compares regenerated content against the
# checked-in file, so a CRLF checkout would report a false "stale artifact".
#
# This also keeps the deployed bytes equal to the pushed bytes: a reviewer
# compares the source on the Explorer against contracts/mandate_vault.py in this
# repository, and a CRLF working copy would deploy a file that differs from the
# one on GitHub in every single line.
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
.gitignore text eol=lf
.gitattributes text eol=lf
